            <ArticleTitle>Ketorolac (Toradol) induced lithium toxicity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>442-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of lithium neurotoxicity in a patient with cluster headache, resulting from coadministration of ketorolac is reported. While lithium interaction with many other NSAIDs is well-known, ketorolac has not been incriminated.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
